        <div class="notes" id="notes-33431768" data-guid="33431768"></div>
        <div id="questions-33431768" data-guid="33431768" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="33431768_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The following table lists the types of development applications authorized by this USDO. For each type of application, the table indicates what type of notice is required, what role City review authorities play in its review, and when a public hearing is required.</div><div class="div landBreak"><div class="codeTable #333" style="border-color:#333"><table class=" frame frameAll" style="border-color:black; font-size: 90%;" tabstyle=""><colgroup><col style="width: 23%"></col><col style="width: 5%"></col><col style="width: 7%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 4%"></col><col style="width: 7%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col><col style="width: 6%"></col></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr class=""><th align="center" class="entry borderBottom" colspan="14" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:#ffffff;background-color:#000000;border-color:black;" valign="bottom"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Table 375.502.1</b></div><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Summary of Development Review Procedures</b></div><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">R = Review and Recommend | D = Review and Decide | (A) = Appeal | [ ] = Public Hearing</b></div></th></tr><tr class=""><th align="left" class="entry botBorder borderRight borderBottom" rowspan="2" scope="col" startcol="1" style="color:black;background-color:#c0c0c0;border-color:black;" valign="bottom"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><b class="bold">Application Type</b></div></th><th align="center" class="entry botBorder borderRight borderBottom" rowspan="2" scope="col" startcol="2" style="color:black;background-color:#c0c0c0;border-color:black;" valign="middle"><di