a zoning clearance.</div></td></tr><tr class=""><td align="left" class="entry" colspan="14" startcol="1" style="border-color:black;" valign="top"><div class="para" style="margin-left:0px;"><sup class="superscript">[2]</sup>A subdivision involving four or fewer lots shall be reviewed as a lot modification.</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 33431769"
